Came across this list by @angus.sewell that includes [@James Goldbach](obj://user/d8f1c0ccde0a4784bc43b57eab7b0154) ... Angus \(The Nontechnical Tech Bro, 54K on IG\) did a brutally honest review of every mainstream AI influencer. I extracted every account he mentioned, verified them all, and compiled them here.

All links verified as of March 2026.

--- INSTAGRAM ---

@angus.sewell \(Angus Sewell, 54K\) — The creator of this list. AI founder giving brutally honest reviews of AI influencers.
[https://www.instagram.com/angus.sewell/](https://www.instagram.com/angus.sewell/)

@askcatgpt \(CatGPT, 576K\) — More of a content creator now than somebody actually deep in AI. Currently building @physicalphones.
[https://www.instagram.com/askcatgpt/](https://www.instagram.com/askcatgpt/)

@sorhan.plays \(Sorhan, 8.3K\) — San Francisco YC bro thing. Finance, startups, AI. You'll like his stuff if you're into the whole SF startup scene.
[https://www.instagram.com/sorhan.plays/](https://www.instagram.com/sorhan.plays/)

@bennettx.ai \(Bennett Spooner, 42.8K\) — Up at 3am playing with n8n. Building @operatoros.ai and @agency.accelerants.
[https://www.instagram.com/bennettx.ai/](https://www.instagram.com/bennettx.ai/)

@agentic.james \(James Goldbach, 33.8K\) — Super smart. Learn agentic AI. Runs Agent Architects on Skool \(you're here!\).
