@edhonour \(Edward S Honour, 250K\) — Legend. CEO @kinetic_seas, author of Oracle How-To.
[https://www.instagram.com/edhonour/](https://www.instagram.com/edhonour/)

@nick_saraev \(Nick Saraev, 463K\) — Also a legend. Founder @ Maker School, LeftClick.
[https://www.instagram.com/nick_saraev/](https://www.instagram.com/nick_saraev/)

