@DaveShap \(David Shapiro, 169K subs\) — Super smart dude. Post-Labor Economics guy. Mission: liberate humanity from drudgery.
[https://www.youtube.com/@DaveShap](https://www.youtube.com/@DaveShap)

@NateBJones \(Nate B Jones, 159K subs\) — This guy gets it. AI News & Strategy Daily. Clear, actionable AI strategy.
